      <y>1550</y>
      <w>803</w>
      <h>69</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>GetWeakConceptsTool stands for any tool; each tool calls an existing service.
COACH_CONVERSATION_STARTED is published once per conversation; ProgressService saves its one-line record.
If the step limit is reached, one more model call without tools summarizes what was done and what remains.</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
